  "content": "<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wishful-recipes\"><img src=\"https://images2.imgbox.com/91/a0/caG03Acz_o.png\" alt=\"此模組已整合至 Wishful Recipes。點擊查看，它能自動動態生成合成配方，因此與其他模組高度相容且無需過多配置。\"/></a>\n<h1><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bGJxy23.png\" alt=\"標題\"/></h1>\n<center><h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong> \n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https%3A%2F%2Fshieldsio-patreon.vercel.app%2Fapi%3Fusername%3DMarsThePlanet%26type%3Dpatrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/smelting-cobblestone-in-blast-a-furnace-fabric\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/845281?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\" /></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/smelting-cobblestone-in-blast-a-furnace-fabricforge\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/smelting-cobblestone-in-blast-a-furnace-fabricforge?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\" /></a>\n</strong></h5></center>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\">這款完全可配置的模組讓您在高爐中熔煉所有石頭方塊的速度比普通熔爐快兩倍。預設情況下，它加入了鵝卵石、石頭、石磚、深板岩碎石、深板岩磚、深板岩瓦、砂岩、紅砂岩、地獄磚、玄武岩、拋光黑石磚、石英方塊和地獄石的熔煉配方，但您可以在配置檔案中新增或移除它們。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/feFVgxd.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\" /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sf89fRO.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\" /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EFCLsqg.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\" /><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zwqoQ5q.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\" /></p></center>\n<details>\n<summary><strong>配置</strong></summary>\n<p>您可以在遊戲內直接配置此模組，或編輯設定檔資料夾中的 JSON 檔案 <code>config/blastingstone.json</code>。請注意，任何變更需要重新啟動 Minecraft 才能生效。</p>\n<center>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>blasting_list</b> - 一個字串列表，每個字串代表一個高爐熔煉配方，指定輸入物品、輸出物品以及熔煉獲得的經驗值</p>\n</center>\n</details>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\"/>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\"/></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/deimos\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\"/></a>\n</p></center>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\" /></a></p>",
